<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Khark Island Raid</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Original Concept By:&lt;/B&gt; Mike Mykytyn &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; September 9th 1985&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Persian Gulf&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; Iraq&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 5 Hours &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;The Iran-Iraq conflict is one of the more interesting time periods for air warfare enthusiasts because the adversaries were so well armed and equally matched to face off against one another. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This small scenario places you in command of an Iraqi attack on Iranian oil facilities on Khark Island in 1985. &lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
